  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 8.3,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "就是你能沉浸在一件事当中"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 9.733,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "而不是judge自己"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 9.733,
      "text": "是不是沉浸在一件事当中"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 12.633,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "这是很有意思"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 16.0,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 12.733,
      "text": "就比如说你在麦当劳打工炸薯条"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 17.166,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 16.0,
      "text": "然后如果你在内心当中"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.3,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 17.166,
      "text": "不断有一个声音说"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 18.3,
      "text": "失败真失败"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 20.7,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 19.733,
      "text": "你看我多惨"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 22.1,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 20.7,
      "text": "对吧就出来打工干这个"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.4,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 22.1,
      "text": "一个小时挣那么点钱"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 26.4,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 23.533,
      "text": "那你就不会成为一个好的打工者"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 28.466,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 26.4,
      "text": "但是如果你能够在炸薯条的时候"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 30.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 28.6,
      "text": "都很认真炸那个薯条"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 30.6,
      "text": "都很开心"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 33.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 31.6,
      "text": "都看到客户的笑脸"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 34.8,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 33.6,
      "text": "感受到有意义"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 36.933,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 34.933,
      "text": "那你肯定不是一个一般的炸薯条的人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 38.566,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 36.933,
      "text": "所以不跟事有关"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 39.066,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 38.566,
      "text": "不是说"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 42.166,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 40.766,
      "text": "找不到我就一直找"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.366,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 42.2,
      "text": "我就持续的找"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 44.6,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 43.4,
      "text": "那你这辈子也找不到"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 46.833,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 44.733,
      "text": "因为你一直在一个找的状态"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 53.3,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 52.133,
      "text": "这是很重要的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.366,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 53.366,
      "text": "你比如说你出门坐火车"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 56.1,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-27",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 55.366,
      "text": "诶"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 56.8,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-28",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 56.1,
      "text": "很不靠谱"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 58.866,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-29",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 56.8,
      "text": "周围全是一些你不喜欢的人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 60.333,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-30",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 58.866,
      "text": "乱七八糟的围着你在那"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 60.8,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-31",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 60.366,
      "text": "我相信"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 63.0,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-32",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 60.8,
      "text": "绝大多数人都会想逃离这个场景"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 65.1,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-33",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 63.066,
      "text": "这时候你的人生就在逐渐的流逝"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 68.466,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-34",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 65.3,
      "text": "你就失去了这一天美好的生活"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 71.5,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 68.466,
      "text": "但如果你能够跟着这些人一块去体验"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 72.766,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-36",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 71.5,
      "text": "那这一天也蛮有意思的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 74.2,
      "id": "youtube-vbKppX43_cs#cue-37",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 72.766,
      "text": "可能以后一辈子都不会这样"
    }
